 ## GPU
 
 Gateway has **no CUDA**. It only HTTP-proxies to the already-running MultoModa daemon. It does not start Jane, Ollama, or a second InsightFace process.
+
+## Env contract
+
+`G:\AI-Home\projects\multomoda-face-studio` and
+`G:\AI-Home\models\insightface` are **one host example**. The runtime
+contract is:
+
+- `FACESWAP_ENGINE` (default `http://127.0.0.1:8855`)
+- `FACESWAP_IOS_PORT` (default `8860`)
+- `FACESWAP_IOS_HOST` (default `0.0.0.0`)
+
+A Linux agent does not need those G: paths. Weights are not in git.
