 ## License
 
 Apache-2.0 for original files in this repo. InsightFace weights stay on the host and are **not** in git.
+
+## Engine contract (env, not G: paths)
+
+The gateway talks to whatever URL these env vars name. `G:\AI-Home\...`
+is one Windows host example, not the contract. Weights stay off git.
+
+| Variable | Default | Meaning |
+|----------|---------|---------|
+| `FACESWAP_ENGINE` | `http://127.0.0.1:8855` | MultoModa / InsightFace health + swap |
+| `FACESWAP_IOS_HOST` | `0.0.0.0` | Gateway bind |
+| `FACESWAP_IOS_PORT` | `8860` | Gateway port |
+
+Linux / this pad: set the three vars. Do not require a `G:` drive.
